		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=31998#p31998"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="quotebox"><cite>SQLpro a écrit&#160;:</cite><blockquote><div><p>J&#039;aimerais bien avoir votre paramétrage d&#039;instance SQL Server car quel chose me chiffonne:</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT name, value_in_use FROM sys.configurations</code></pre></div><p>A +</p></div></blockquote></div><div class="codebox"><pre class="vscroll"><code>1&gt; SELECT name ,cast(value_in_use as nvarchar(16)) as value FROM sys.configurations
2&gt; go
